      "canvasUri": "canvases/canvas-p-8HV-LOe1",
      "content": "\n\n<columns>\n[https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su0opxmi](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su0opxmi)\n\n\n\n|||\n\n[https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suV-LOe1](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suV-LOe1) for [Math4Wisdom](https://www.math4wisdom.com/) contains information about the project such as: \n</columns>\n\n- [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sujqBh-1](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sujqBh-1) \n\n- [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su0opxmi](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su0opxmi) \n\n- [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suwlf3Jt](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suwlf3Jt) like [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suCwO2Pw](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suCwO2Pw) & [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su44bth2](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su44bth2)\n\n- [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su2_Sy3a](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su2_Sy3a) like the [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su9rdBm7](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su9rdBm7) \n\n- [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sugFmpP_](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sugFmpP_) like [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su8wp-W6](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su8wp-W6)\n\n- Please use [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sugYI5Ax](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sugYI5Ax) for making any requests of the [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suSWQ4PS](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suSWQ4PS) stewards, and tag <formula id=\"f-9h76Hue9YX\">Daniel Ari Friedman</formula> . \n\nAs a start for [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_subWlqVP](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_subWlqVP)-scale work, a preliminary categorization is:\n\n<columns>\n[https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sumWz2XL](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sumWz2XL) + [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suEcSGnw](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suEcSGnw) \n\n[https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sujjvM3E](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sujjvM3E) \n\n[https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suQWY5DS](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suQWY5DS) \n\n[https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suGCORpG](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suGCORpG)\n\n|||\n\n- [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sufZveSi](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sufZveSi) like: \n  - [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_subZHKAF](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_subZHKAF), [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su-YQoTU](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su-YQoTU), and [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suPdiY8D](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suPdiY8D). [Synergetics](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sugFmpP_).\n  - [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sumWz2XL](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sumWz2XL) and [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suITdICd](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suITdICd) and [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suEcSGnw](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suEcSGnw) \n- [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_subpHvLx](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_subpHvLx) and [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suaEEPT0](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suaEEPT0) like: Perplexity, ChatGPT, Wiki, [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suSWQ4PS](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suSWQ4PS), Jupyter...\n</columns>\n\n---\n\nFeel free to add comments or enter the “suggest edits” mode by selecting text, and clicking pencil on the right side of the screen. \n\n---\n\nUpcoming Meetings View\n\n",
